  "notes": "Map is the full-bleed backdrop; both side panels float over it as rounded (16px) #fafafa sheets with soft shadow and collapse via edge toggles. Places are color-coded by category (orange bar/cafe, purple attraction, red restaurant, blue hotel, lime nature, green activity, gray transport) as circular filled pins with white line icons, consistent across list, itinerary and map. Day headers show a day-number tile with average temperature (Ø21°) and the hotel booking chip. Non-place items (notes, ticket bookings, transport) appear as tinted rounded sub-cards (light red for restaurant reservations, amber for tickets, blue for flights). Pill-shaped near-black 'Plan' active tab and black primary buttons give a monochrome brand; time chips are small outlined pills."
